# Docker resolves .dockerignore against the build context, which for this
# service is ./config/backrest — a file at the repository root never applies.
# config.json is the rendered template and carries the S3 credentials and the
# restic repository password.
config.json
# Its rotation backups carry the same secrets, and backrest.env carries the API
# password. Nothing COPYs them today, but they are still uploaded to the daemon
# as part of the build context.
config.json.bak.*
*.env
